    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOpen Viewing - No 9 Bayly Hill\n\nSaturday 19 September 11am12pm\n\nThese beautifully designed 4-bed homes are located in the sought-after Bayly development in Douglas, Cork with panoramic views over Cork City. Contact kate.buttimer@savills.ie for more info\n\nBuilt with energy efficiency and sustainability in mind, the home boasts a BER A2 rating, air-to-water heat pump, high-performance windows, and excellent insulation throughout ensuring comfort and low running costs.\n\nInside, the layout is thoughtfully planned to maximise light, space, and storage. Large windows frame the surrounding views, while clever design ensures practical everyday living for families or those looking to trade up.\n\nSet within a landscaped development, the home is surrounded by green spaces, play areas, and preserved natural features including mature trees and innovative Greenwalls that blend nature with modern living.\n\nIdeally situated just 3.5km from Cork City, Douglas offers a village feel with excellent amenities, schools, shops, restaurants, parks, and easy access to public transport, major roads, and cycling routes.\n\nThis home offers the perfect balance of modern design, energy-efficient living, and a vibrant community setting.\n\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, contact Savills on 021 427 1371."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Approx. 42 sq m / 1534 sq ft </li><li>4 Bedroom Family Home </li><li>Two Patio Areas leading off kitchen </li><li>Spacious open plan kitchen/living/dining </li><li>A2 Energy rating</ul>"
      },
